## Aspire
**/aspire-manifest.json

# Deployment secrets — the filled-in production settings and Web Deploy profiles carry the database
# password, the token signing key, and the hosting login. Only the templates are tracked.
deploy/**/appsettings.Production.json
*.publishSettings
*.pubxml.user

# Control-panel screenshots — these carry hosting server names and logins.
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
!src/**/wwwroot/**/*.png
!src/**/wwwroot/**/*.jpg

# Local database backups left behind by a migration. The uploaded competition images under
# wwwroot/uploads stay tracked — they were committed deliberately and a clone needs them.
*.db.bak-*
